END PROGRAM TREE-NODE-GET-RIGHT.

IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. TREE-NODE-SET-LEFT.
DATA DIVISION.
LINKAGE SECTION.
COPY "DATA-STRUCTURES-ADVANCED-PARAMS".
01 LN-NODE             USAGE POINTER.
