END PROGRAM TREE-NODE-SET-LEFT.

IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. TREE-NODE-SET-RIGHT.
DATA DIVISION.
LINKAGE SECTION.
COPY "DATA-STRUCTURES-ADVANCED-PARAMS".
